# --- ai_context tracking choice (FRAMEWORK.md par. 4.10) — pick ONE and record it at scaffold ---
# Framework default: TRACK .claude/ai_context so plans travel with the code. For that, replace the
# `.claude/` line below with just:   .claude/settings.local.json
# Opt-out (orgs treating intent+design as IP): keep ALL of .claude/ local-only and back it up
# out-of-band — an untracked tree has NO remote copy. That opt-out is the safe default shipped here:
